  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 40ba2d36045d4c14687473e4e9707b79, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DiceFree.World.Runtime::DiceFree.World.ConversationTarget
  displayName: Envoy Tamsin
  range: 2.5
  approachPoint: {fileID: 225100999}
  context: {fileID: 0}
  npcId: npc.willowford.envoy-tamsin
  conversationId: report.world2.two-pips
  dialogue: Ivara's field notes, and your account of both watchposts. Good. We have a map and witnesses now, rather than another rumour. I will send the record to the Verdant Council. The Ashscales keep watch around both landmarks, but that alone does not make them the dragon's servants. Nothing here yet explains why he appeared outside the Dice. Willowford will hold the expedition's records while we decide where to investigate next.
